    "html": "<div style=\"width: 1728px; height: 1152px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; color: #1B2440\">\n<div style=\"width: 864px; height: 1152px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #F7F6F2; padding: 96px 88px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 36px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; color: #16306E\">Questions? We're here.</h2>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.5\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 600\">Advanced Joint Pain &amp; Vascular Center, {{CITY}}</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0\">{{STREET}}<br>{{CITY_STATE_ZIP}}</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0\">Phone 661-324-4100 · Fax 661-324-4600</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0\">heartandleg.com</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0\">{{HOURS}}</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-size: 26px; color: #16306E\">We treat pain in the</h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.5\">Knee · Hip · Shoulder · Hand · Wrist · Ankle · Lower back · Heel</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFEFB; border: 1px solid #E2DED4; border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-size: 26px; color: #C8231E\">After hours</h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.5\">For urgent concerns after a procedure, call 661-324-4100. For an emergency, call 911.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 32px\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px\">\n<div style=\"width: 130px; height: 130px; flex: none; border: 2px dashed #8A93A6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; font-size: 15px; color: #4A5568\">[QR CODE]</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.45; color: #4A5568\">Scan to book a follow-up, read prep instructions, or leave a review.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px\">\n<img src=\"assets/qr-testimonial.png\" alt=\"QR code linking to a patient testimonial video\" style=\"width: 130px; height: 130px; flex: none; display: block\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #C8231E\">Scan to watch</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.25; color: #16306E\">Hear a patient's story</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4; color: #4A5568\">Runtime 6:30<br>Individual results vary</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; color: #4A5568\">Advanced Joint Pain &amp; Vascular Center is a division of Heart Vascular &amp; Leg Center.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"width: 864px; height: 1152px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #16306E; color: #FFFEFB; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"height: 20px; background: #C8231E\"></div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; padding: 88px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px\">\n<div style=\"background: #FFFEFB; border-radius: 20px; padding: 32px; display: flex; justify-content: center\">\n<img src=\"assets/logo-tall.png\" alt=\"Advanced Joint Pain &amp; Vascular Center logo\" style=\"width: 560px; height: 560px; object-fit: contain\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2A7A3\">Patient guide</p>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 64px; line-height: 1.05\">Your joint care, step by step</h1>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
