    "html": "<div style=\"width: 816px; height: 1056px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FFFEFB; font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"padding: 30px 56px 24px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 26px\"><img src=\"assets/logo-hvlc.png\" alt=\"Heart Vascular &amp; Leg Center logo\" style=\"height: 64px; width: 147px; object-fit: contain; object-position: left center\"><span style=\"width: 1px; height: 51px; background: #E2DED4\"></span><img src=\"assets/logo-long-nodivision.png\" alt=\"Advanced Joint Pain &amp; Vascular Center logo\" style=\"height: 64px; width: 243px; object-fit: contain; object-position: left center\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"background: #16306E; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 40px 56px 36px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2A7A3\">For physicians, NPs and PAs</p>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 50px; line-height: 1.05\">Your Referral Partner for Joint, Artery &amp; Vein Care</h1>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.45; color: #D9E1F2\">Minimally invasive, image-guided treatment in Bakersfield, with notes back to you after every visit.</p>\n</div>\n<img src=\"assets/photo-exam.jpg\" alt=\"A physician examines an older woman’s knee in a clinic exam room\" style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; width: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 35%; display: block\">\n<div style=\"background: #C8231E; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 22px 56px 26px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 22px; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px\">\n<span>Joint embolization</span><span>·</span><span>PAD &amp; limb salvage</span><span>·</span><span>Vein care</span><span>·</span><span>Same-day DVT rule-out</span>\n</div></div>"
