    "html": "<div style=\"width: 816px; height: 1056px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FFFEFB; color: #1B2440; font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<header style=\"background: #16306E; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 40px 56px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; border-bottom: 8px solid #C8231E\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2A7A3\">Referring provider guide</p>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 38px; line-height: 1.1\">Services at a Glance</h1>\n</header>\n<main style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; padding: 30px 56px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20.7px\">\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20.7px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 600; color: #16306E\">From the first test to the procedure and follow-up, your patient’s care stays in one place.</p>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #E2DED4\"><thead><tr><th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 13.8px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #FFFFFF; background: #16306E\">Patient presents with</th><th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 13.8px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #FFFFFF; background: #16306E\">We evaluate with</th><th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 13.8px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #FFFFFF; background: #16306E\">We may treat with</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"background: #FFFFFF\"><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15.52px; color: #16306E; vertical-align: top\">Knee, hip, shoulder, hand or heel pain</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 14.95px; line-height: 1.4; vertical-align: top\">X-ray / MRI review</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 14.95px; line-height: 1.4; vertical-align: top\">GAE, TAME, plantar fasciitis embolization</td></tr><tr style=\"background: #F7F6F2\"><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15.52px; color: #16306E; vertical-align: top\">Claudication, rest pain, nonhealing wounds</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 14.95px; line-height: 1.4; vertical-align: top\">ABI, exercise ABI, SPP, arterial duplex</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 14.95px; line-height: 1.4; vertical-align: top\">Angiography, angioplasty, stenting, atherectomy; HBOT</td></tr><tr style=\"background: #FFFFFF\"><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15.52px; color: #16306E; vertical-align: top\">Varicose veins, venous swelling, venous ulcers</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 14.95px; line-height: 1.4; vertical-align: top\">Reflux duplex, vein mapping</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 14.95px; line-height: 1.4; vertical-align: top\">RFA, VenaSeal, Varithena, phlebectomy, sclerotherapy</td></tr><tr style=\"background: #F7F6F2\"><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15.52px; color: #16306E; vertical-align: top\">Suspected DVT, post-thrombotic legs</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 14.95px; line-height: 1.4; vertical-align: top\">Same-day venous duplex</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 14.95px; line-height: 1.4; vertical-align: top\">Venography, deep vein stenting, IVC filter placement and removal</td></tr><tr style=\"background: #FFFFFF\"><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15.52px; color: #16306E; vertical-align: top\">Dialysis access dysfunction</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 14.95px; line-height: 1.4; vertical-align: top\">Access evaluation</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 14.95px; line-height: 1.4; vertical-align: top\">Fistulagram, angioplasty, stenting</td></tr><tr style=\"background: #F7F6F2\"><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15.52px; color: #16306E; vertical-align: top\">Carotid, renal and aortic disease</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 14.95px; line-height: 1.4; vertical-align: top\">Carotid, renal artery and aortic ultrasound</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 14.95px; line-height: 1.4; vertical-align: top\">Carotid angiography and stroke-prevention planning</td></tr><tr style=\"background: #FFFFFF\"><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15.52px; color: #16306E; vertical-align: top\">Cardiac symptoms</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 14.95px; line-height: 1.4; vertical-align: top\">Echo, stress echo, stress test, EKG, Holter, Zio</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 14.95px; line-height: 1.4; vertical-align: top\">Cardiac catheterization, angioplasty and stenting</td></tr><tr style=\"background: #F7F6F2\"><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15.52px; color: #16306E; vertical-align: top\">Internal hemorrhoids</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 14.95px; line-height: 1.4; vertical-align: top\">Consultation</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 14.95px; line-height: 1.4; vertical-align: top\">Hemorrhoidal artery embolization (HAE)</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14.95px; line-height: 1.4; color: #4A5568\">Treatment is recommended only when it is medically appropriate. Your patient returns to you for ongoing primary care.</p>\n\n</main>\n<footer style=\"padding: 14px 56px 26px; display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 14px; font-size: 12px; color: #4A5568\">\n<span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #16306E\">3</span><span>Advanced Joint Pain &amp; Vascular Center · Heart Vascular &amp; Leg Center</span>\n</footer>\n</div>"
