    "html": "<div style=\"width: 816px; height: 1056px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FFFEFB; color: #1B2440; font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 56px 56px 40px; gap: 26px\">\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 36px; color: #16306E\">Refer a Patient</h1>\n<div style=\"background: #16306E; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px 30px 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25)\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #D9E1F2\">Referral fax</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; white-space: nowrap\">661-324-4600</span></div><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25)\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #D9E1F2\">Appointments</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; white-space: nowrap\">661-324-4100</span></div><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25)\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #D9E1F2\">Referral coordinator</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; white-space: nowrap\">661-459-9010</span></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25)\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #D9E1F2\">Secure email</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 18px\">referrals@heartandleg.com</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; align-items: start\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; min-width: 0\"><h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.2; color: #16306E\">Main Office</h2><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5\">5020 Commerce Drive<br>Bakersfield, CA 93309</p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5\">Monday to Friday, 8 AM to 6 PM</p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5\">heartandleg.com · Se habla español</p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #4A5568\">Advanced Joint Pain &amp; Vascular Center satellite locations: call the coordinator or visit our website for the current list.</p></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0px; min-width: 0\"><div style=\"background: #F7F6F2; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #C8231E\">Your liaison</p><span style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #B8B2A6; height: 24px\"></span><span style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #B8B2A6; height: 24px\"></span><span style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #B8B2A6; height: 24px\"></span></div></div></div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4A5568\">For referring health care professionals. Procedures are recommended only when medically appropriate; individual results vary, and not every patient is a candidate. Coverage varies by plan.</p>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #E2DED4; padding-top: 22px\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 26px\"><img src=\"assets/logo-hvlc.png\" alt=\"Heart Vascular &amp; Leg Center logo\" style=\"height: 60px; width: 138px; object-fit: contain; object-position: left center\"><span style=\"width: 1px; height: 48px; background: #E2DED4\"></span><img src=\"assets/logo-long-nodivision.png\" alt=\"Advanced Joint Pain &amp; Vascular Center logo\" style=\"height: 60px; width: 228px; object-fit: contain; object-position: left center\"></div></div>\n</div>"
