    "html": "<div style=\"width: 1056px; height: 816px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FFFEFB; color: #1B2440; font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 34px 44px 26px; gap: 20px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 24px; border-bottom: 5px solid #C8231E; padding-bottom: 14px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #C8231E\">Joint pain</p>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.05; color: #16306E\">Hip Arthritis Pain</h1></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px\"><img src=\"assets/logo-hvlc.png\" alt=\"Heart Vascular &amp; Leg Center logo\" style=\"height: 34px; width: 78px; object-fit: contain; object-position: left center\"><span style=\"width: 1px; height: 27px; background: #E2DED4\"></span><img src=\"assets/logo-long-nodivision.png\" alt=\"Advanced Joint Pain &amp; Vascular Center logo\" style=\"height: 34px; width: 129px; object-fit: contain; object-position: left center\"></div></div>\n<main style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; gap: 30px\"><div style=\"flex: 1.45; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 18px; overflow: hidden; display: flex\"><img src=\"assets/render-hip.png\" alt=\"Illustration of a hip joint with the inflamed area highlighted in red\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; object-position: 50% 50%; display: block\"></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px\"><span style=\"background: #C8231E; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; padding: 7px 16px; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap\">TAME</span></div></div><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 20px\"><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start\"><span style=\"width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 50%; background: #C8231E; flex: none; margin-top: 10px\"></span><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.35; color: #1B2440\">Arthritis can inflame the lining of the hip</p></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start\"><span style=\"width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 50%; background: #C8231E; flex: none; margin-top: 10px\"></span><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.35; color: #1B2440\">Pain in the groin, thigh or buttock, worse with walking</p></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start\"><span style=\"width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 50%; background: #C8231E; flex: none; margin-top: 10px\"></span><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.35; color: #1B2440\">TAME may ease pain for those not ready for surgery</p></div></div></main></div>"
