    "h": 816,
    "html": "<div style=\"width: 1056px; height: 816px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FFFFFF; color: #1B2440; font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"background: #16306E; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 22px 44px 18px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; border-bottom: 5px solid #C8231E\">\n<div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2A7A3\">Provider talking points · 06</p>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 4px 0 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.1\">Hand OA and TAME</h1></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #D9E1F2\">Patient sees the facing page</p></div>\n<main style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; padding: 22px 44px 14px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 26.0px 40px; align-content: start\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10.4px\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22.1px; color: #16306E\">Explain it simply</p><ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6.5px; font-size: 19.5px; line-height: 1.42\"><li>Hand OA often involves inflamed, swollen joints.</li><li>Retrospective series report pain improvement; evidence is early.</li><li>Screen for Raynaud’s or digital ischemia.</li></ul></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10.4px\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22.1px; color: #16306E\">Treatment options</p><ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6.5px; font-size: 19.5px; line-height: 1.42\"><li>Splints, hand therapy</li><li>Topical or oral NSAIDs, injections</li><li>TAME</li><li>Surgery for advanced thumb-base disease</li></ul></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10.4px\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22.1px; color: #16306E\">Ask your patient</p><ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6.5px; font-size: 19.5px; line-height: 1.42\"><li>Which joints hurt most?</li><li>Any color changes in the fingers in the cold?</li></ul></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10.4px\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22.1px; color: #C8231E\">Refer when</p><ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6.5px; font-size: 19.5px; line-height: 1.42\"><li>Persistent pain despite splinting, therapy and medicine</li></ul></div>\n</main>\n<div style=\"padding: 12px 44px 18px; border-top: 1px solid #E2DED4; display: flex; gap: 28px; font-size: 14px; color: #4A5568\">\n<span>Referral fax <b style=\"color: #16306E\">661-324-4600</b></span><span>Coordinator <b style=\"color: #16306E\">661-459-9010</b></span><span>Appointments <b style=\"color: #16306E\">661-324-4100</b></span></div></div>"
