    "label": "Page 6",
    "w": 816,
    "h": 1056,
    "html": "<div style=\"width: 816px; height: 1056px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FFFEFB; color: #1B2440; font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<header style=\"background: #16306E; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 40px 56px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; border-bottom: 8px solid #C8231E\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2A7A3\">Arterial &amp; venous guide</p>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 38px; line-height: 1.1\">Your Treatment Plan</h1>\n</header>\n<main style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; padding: 30px 56px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px\">\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 600; color: #16306E\">After testing, you and your specialist will make a plan together. Most plans combine healthy habits with treatment.</p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; align-items: start\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; min-width: 0\"><h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.2; color: #16306E\">Treatment Options</h2><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-left: 0px; background: #F7F6F2; color: #1B2440; border-radius: 10px; padding: 9px 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 19px; width: 20px; flex: none; color: #C8231E\">1</span><span style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15.5px\">Healthy habits</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.35; color: #4A5568\">A walking program, quitting smoking, managing weight</span></span></div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-left: 12px; background: #F7F6F2; color: #1B2440; border-radius: 10px; padding: 9px 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 19px; width: 20px; flex: none; color: #C8231E\">2</span><span style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15.5px\">Compression stockings</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.35; color: #4A5568\">For vein problems and leg swelling</span></span></div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-left: 24px; background: #F7F6F2; color: #1B2440; border-radius: 10px; padding: 9px 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 19px; width: 20px; flex: none; color: #C8231E\">3</span><span style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15.5px\">Medicines</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.35; color: #4A5568\">To prevent clots and control cholesterol, blood pressure and diabetes</span></span></div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-left: 36px; background: #F7F6F2; color: #1B2440; border-radius: 10px; padding: 9px 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 19px; width: 20px; flex: none; color: #C8231E\">4</span><span style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15.5px\">Wound care</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.35; color: #4A5568\">Special dressings and, for some wounds, hyperbaric oxygen</span></span></div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-left: 48px; background: #16306E; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 9px 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 19px; width: 20px; flex: none; color: #F2A7A3\">5</span><span style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15.5px\">Minimally invasive procedures</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.35; color: #D9E1F2\">Done through a small puncture, usually outpatient</span></span></div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-left: 60px; background: #F7F6F2; color: #1B2440; border-radius: 10px; padding: 9px 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 19px; width: 20px; flex: none; color: #C8231E\">6</span><span style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15.5px\">Surgery</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.35; color: #4A5568\">Such as bypass, when other options aren’t right</span></span></div></div></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; min-width: 0\"><h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.2; color: #16306E\">Good to Know</h2><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5\"><b>Insurance and compression stockings.</b> Many plans require you to wear compression stockings for several weeks before they cover a vein procedure. Our team will tell you what your plan requires.</p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5\"><b>Walking helps.</b> For PAD, a regular walking program can increase how far you can walk without pain. Ask about a supervised exercise program, which many plans, including Medicare, cover.</p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5\"><b>Smoking matters.</b> Quitting is one of the most important things you can do for your arteries.</p></div></div>\n<div style=\"background: #F7F6F2; border-top: 5px solid #16306E; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\"><h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.2; color: #16306E\">Questions to Ask Your Doctor</h2><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; align-items: start\"><ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45\"><li>What is causing my symptoms?</li><li>What are my treatment options?</li><li>What are the risks for someone like me?</li></ul><ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45\"><li>How long is recovery?</li><li>Will my insurance cover it, and what will I pay?</li></ul></div></div>\n\n</main>\n<footer style=\"padding: 14px 56px 26px; display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; gap: 14px; font-size: 12px; color: #4A5568\">\n<span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #16306E\">6</span><span>Advanced Joint Pain &amp; Vascular Center · Heart Vascular &amp; Leg Center</span>\n</footer>\n</div>"
